rtcomings.\n**Remaining uncertainty:**\u202fThe practical impact of C\u2019s communication difficulty and egocentric attitude on real\u2011time crew coordination, and whether his reluctance to pursue further education will affect long\u2011term suitability, remain unclear.\n**What would change my vote:**\u202fConcrete evidence that B\u2019s communication style is consistently effective in crew settings, or that A\u2019s leadership reliably overcomes his interpersonal drawbacks, or that D\u2019s problem\u2011solving ability substantially mitigates his moodiness and isolation, would lead me to reconsider.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_1\", \"vote\": \"Candidate C\"}", "thoughts": "We need to produce output as agent_1 (internal name). The system says output only two sections: PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON. Must follow format. We need to state current position, summarize evidence, etc. Agent_1 previously favored Candidate C. Now after seeing others also favor C, we likely continue with Candidate C. Provide confidence maybe 70-80%. Include evidence from own and others. Provide tradeoffs, uncertainties, what would change vote. Then METADATA_JSON with agent \"agent_1\" and vote \"Candidate C\". Ensure correct JSON formatting.\n\nLet's craft concise but thorough public message."}
